Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 10:03:30 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 04/13] fix(mddbd): runtime + tests compatibility for Windows

- replaceFile helper: Windows os.Rename cannot overwrite existing dest;
  remove-then-rename path (replacefile_unix/windows.go) used by copyFile
  and ReplicationClient.replaceDatabase.
- tests: use filepath.Join(t.TempDir(), ...) for auth DB paths instead of
  /tmp; skip UDS listener tests on Windows where unix sockets are
  unsupported; shortSocketDir uses os.TempDir() on Windows.
- mddb-cli: open GraphQL playground via 'cmd /c start' on Windows.

The CI workflow that adds the windows-latest runtime test job is committed
separately under .github/workflows/build-windows.yml and applies this
vendor patch series at build time.
---
